              <run> now.&#10;- If </run>
              <run bold='true'>Weekly</run>
              <run> or </run>
              <run bold='true'>Monthly</run>
              <run> are picked as granularity, the calculation of the `# Users ` would be the average. For example, the `# GoDroid Users ` on Weekly granularity would be  &quot;Sum of Daily GoDroid Users&quot; / 7 days for the week.</run>
